<Page title="About ResultDosti" description="ResultDosti is an independent website that tracks official government recruitment updates for job seekers in India.">
  <p>ResultDosti is an independent information website for people preparing for government jobs in India. It tracks the official websites of recruitment commissions, boards and departments, and lists their new job notices, admit cards, answer keys and results in one place, through the day.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Check official websites such as UPSC, SSC, Railway Recruitment Boards, IBPS, NTA, UPSSSC, UPPSC, BPSC, BSSC and others several times a day.</li>
    <li>List each new update with the date it was published and a link to the official notice or website.</li>
    <li>Read key dates, fee and age limits from official notification PDFs where they can be read reliably, and check them for consistency before showing them.</li>
    <li>Group updates of the same exam together, so you can follow an exam from notification to result on one page.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we are not</h2>
  <p>ResultDosti is not a government website and is not connected with any government body, recruitment board or other job portal. We do not conduct exams, take applications or collect fees. Always confirm details on the official website before you apply.</p>
  <p>Read <a href="/how-we-verify/">how we verify updates</a>, or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> at {site.email}.</p>
</Page>
